Package: graceful-desktop-environment
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: dingjing <dingjing@localhost>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, liblightdm-gobject-1-0, libx11-6, lightdm, mutter, ibus, ibus-rime, gnome-terminal | terminator | mate-terminal, nautilus | caja, gnome-control-center, gnome-screensaver | xdg-utils, systemd
Description: Graceful GTK desktop environment
 Graceful Desktop Environment provides a LightDM greeter, session root
 process, wallpaper desktop process and single GTK panel.
